    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Buys a coin with exactly `xlm_in` XLM. On the curve (`on_curve`), XLM is first swapped into the coin's pair\\nasset through `path`; on the first launchpad `path` must be empty and the coin's buy fee is paid as usual.\\nCoins go to `user`, and any XLM not spent goes back. Returns the coins bought.",
      "name": "buy",
